msgstr "किरा"

#: hacks/config/sphere.xml.h:1
msgid ""
"Another of the classic screenhacks of the distant past, this one draws "
"shaded spheres in multiple colors. This hack traces its lineage back to Tom "
"Duff in 1982."
msgstr ""
"पृथक पूर्वको शास्त्रिय स्क्रिनह्याकहरू, यो एउटाले बहुँविध रङहरूमा छायाँ गरिएको चक्र कोर्दछ । "
"यो ह्याकले १९८२ मा टोम डफसँग यसको वंशवाली पदचिन्ह गर्दछ । "

#: hacks/config/sphere.xml.h:7
msgid "Sphere"
msgstr "गोला"

#: hacks/config/sphereEversion.xml.h:1
msgid "SphereEversion"
msgstr "गोलाइभर्सन"

#: hacks/config/sphereEversion.xml.h:2
msgid ""
"SphereEversion draws an animation of a sphere being turned inside out. A "
"sphere can be turned inside out, without any tears, sharp creases or "
"discontinuities, if the surface of the sphere is allowed to intersect "
"itself. This program animates what is known as the Thurston Eversion. "
"Written by Nathaniel Thurston and Michael McGuffin. This program is not "
"included with the XScreenSaver package, but if you don't have it already, "
"you can find it at &lt;http://www.dgp.utoronto.ca/~mjmcguff/eversion/&gt;."
msgstr ""
"स्फेयरइभर्सनले बाहिर भित्र घुमेको कारणले गर्दा चक्रको एउटा एनिमेसन कोर्दछ । यदि चक्रको "
"सतहलाई आफै प्रतिच्छेदन गर्ने अनुमति छ भने, एउटा चक्र आशु बिना, धारिलो धार बिना वा "
"निरन्तरता नदिइकन बाहिर भित्र घुमाउन सकिन्छ । यो कार्यक्रमले थ्रसटोन इभर्सन के हो भन्ने "
"एनिमेट गर्दछ । नाथानियल थ्रसटोन र माइकल म्याकगफिनद्वारा लिखित । यो कार्यक्रम एक्स "
"स्क्रिनसेभर प्याकेजसँग समावेश गरिएको छैन, तर यदि तपाईँसँग पहिल्ये छैन भने, तपाईँ यसलाई &lt;"
"http://www.dgp.utoronto.ca/~mjmcguff/eversion/&gt; मा फेला पार्न सक्नुहुन्छ ।"

#: hacks/config/spheremonics.xml.h:9
msgid "Resolution"
msgstr "रिजोल्युसन"

#: hacks/config/spheremonics.xml.h:20
msgid "Smoothed Lines"
msgstr "मिलेको पङ्क्ति"

#: hacks/config/spheremonics.xml.h:23
msgid "Spheremonics"
msgstr "समान गोला"

#: hacks/config/spheremonics.xml.h:24
msgid ""
"These closed objects are commonly called spherical harmonics, although they "
"are only remotely related to the mathematical definition found in the "
"solution to certain wave functions, most notable the eigenfunctions of "
"angular momentum operators. Written by Paul Bourke and Jamie Zawinski."
msgstr ""
"यी नजिकका वस्तुहरू साझा रूपमा गोलाकार हारमोनिक्सको रूपमा चिनिन्छ, यद्यपि तिनीहरू तरङ्ग "
"प्रकार्य निश्चित गर्न समाधानमा फेला परेका गणितिय परिभाषामा टाढा रूपमा सम्बन्धित भएता "
"पनि, धेरैजसोले कोणिक मोमेन्टम सञ्चालकहरूको इगेनप्रकार्यको रूपमा नोट गर्दछ । पाउल बाउर्क र "
"जामिइ जाविन्स्कीद्वारा लिखित ।"

#: hacks/config/spiral.xml.h:2
msgid "Cycles"
msgstr "साईकल"

#: hacks/config/spiral.xml.h:7
msgid ""
"Moving circular patterns, by Peter Schmitzberger. Moving circular patterns "
"means moire; interference patterns, of course."
msgstr ""
"वृत्तकार बाँन्कीहरू सारेर, पेटर स्किम्जबर्गरले लेखिएको हो । वृत्तकार बाँन्कीहरूको अर्थ वास्तवमा "
"मोइर; व्यतिरण बाँन्कीहरू हुन् ।"

#: hacks/config/spiral.xml.h:11
msgid "Spiral"
msgstr "पेचदार"

#: hacks/config/spotlight.xml.h:1
msgid ""
"Draws a spotlight scanning across a black screen, illumnating the underlying "
"desktop when it passes. Written by Rick Schultz."
msgstr ""
"यो पास हुँदा अन्तरनिर्हित डेस्कटप हटाएर, कालो पर्दा वरिपरि स्पोटलाइट स्क्यानिङ कोर्दछ । "
"रिक स्कल्जद्वारा लिखित ।"

#: hacks/config/spotlight.xml.h:6
msgid "Spotlight"
msgstr "स्पटलाइट"

#: hacks/config/sproingies.xml.h:3
msgid "Q-Bert meets Marble Madness! Written by Ed Mackey."
msgstr "क्यु-बर्टले मार्बल म्याडनेसलाई भेट्दछ! एड म्याकेद्वारा लिखित ।"

#: hacks/config/sproingies.xml.h:9
msgid "Sproingies"
msgstr "स्पोरिङ्गिज"

#: hacks/config/squiral.xml.h:3
msgid ""
"Draws a set of interacting, square-spiral-producing automata. The spirals "
"grow outward until they hit something, then they go around it. Written by "
"Jeff Epler."
msgstr ""
"अन्तरक्रियात्मक, वर्ग-स्पाइरल-उत्पादन गरिरहेको अटोमाटाको सेट कोर्दछ । तिनीहरूले केही "
"चीजलाई हान्दा सम्म स्पाइरल बाहिर वृद्धि हुन्छ, त्यसपछि तिनीहरू यसको वरिपरि जान्छ । जेफ "
"इपलरद्वारा लिखित ।"

#: hacks/config/squiral.xml.h:5
msgid "Handedness"
msgstr "हात नभएको"

#: hacks/config/squiral.xml.h:7
msgid "Left"
msgstr "बायाँ"

#: hacks/config/squiral.xml.h:11 hacks/config/twang.xml.h:8
msgid "Randomness"
msgstr "र्यान्डमनेस"

#: hacks/config/squiral.xml.h:12
msgid "Right"
msgstr "दायाँ"

#: hacks/config/squiral.xml.h:17
msgid "Squiral"
msgstr "स्क्वाइरल"

#: hacks/config/ssystem.xml.h:1
msgid "SSystem"
msgstr "एस प्रणाली"

#: hacks/config/ssystem.xml.h:2
msgid ""
"SSystem is a GL Solar System simulator. It simulates flybys of Sun, the nine "
"planets and a few major satellites, with four camera modes. Written by Raul "
"Alonso. This is not included with the XScreenSaver package, but is packaged "
"separately. Note: SSystem does not work as a screen saver on all systems, "
"because it doesn't communicate with xscreensaver properly. It happens to "
"work with some window managers, but not with others, so your mileage may "
"vary. SSystem was once available at &lt;http://www1.las.es/~amil/ssystem/"
"&gt;, but is now gone. You may still be able to find copies elsewhere. "
"SSystem has since evolved into two different programs: OpenUniverse (http://"
"openuniverse.sourceforge.net/) and Celestia (http://www.shatters.net/"
"celestia/). Sadly, neither of these programs work with xscreensaver at all. "
"You are encouraged to nag their authors into adding xscreensaver support!"
msgstr ""
"एसप्रणाली जीएल सौर्य प्रणाली अनुकारी हो । यसले चार क्यामेरा मोडद्वारा, घाम, नौ ग्रहहरू "
"र केही मुख्य उपग्रहहरूको फ्लाइबाइको नक्कल गर्दछ । राउल एलोनसोद्वारा लिखित । यो एक्स "
"स्क्रिनसेभर प्याकेजमा समावेश भएको छैन, तर भिन्दा भिन्दै प्याक गरिएको छ । द्रष्टब्य: "
"एसप्रणालीले सबै प्रणालीमा स्क्रिनसेभरको रूपमा कार्य गर्दैन, किनभने यसले उचित तरीकाले एक्स "
"स्क्रिनसेभरसँग सञ्चार गर्न सक्दैन । यो केही विन्डोज प्रबन्धकहरूसँग काम गर्न भएको हो, तर "
"अरुसँग होइन, त्यसैले तपाईँको माइलेज फरक हुन सक्छ । एसप्रणाली एकपटक &lt;http://www1.las."
"es/~amil/ssystem/&gt; मा उपलब्ध थियो, तर अहिले गयो । तपाईँ अझै पनि कहीँ यसको "
"प्रतिलिपि फेला पार्न सक्नुहुन्छ । एसप्रणाली अहिले सम्म दुईवटा भिन्नै कार्यक्रममा संलग्न "
"भइसकेको छ: OpenUniverse (http://openuniverse.sourceforge.net/) र Celestia "
"(http://www.shatters.net/celestia/). तर दु:ख लाग्दो कुरा के भने, यी कार्यक्रमहरू कुनैले "
"एक्स स्क्रिनसेभरसँग काम गरेन । तपाईँलाई एक्सस्क्रिनसेभरमा समर्थनमा थप्न तिनीहरूको लेखकहरूलाई "
"सताउन उत्प्रेरित गरिन्छ!"

#: hacks/config/stairs.xml.h:6
msgid "Stairs"
msgstr "सीढी"

#: hacks/config/stairs.xml.h:8
msgid ""
"by Marcelo Vianna's third Escher GL hack, this one draws an ``infinite'' "
"staircase."
msgstr ""
"मार्सेलो भियानाको तेस्रो इचर जीएल ह्याकद्वारा, यो एउटा ``अनन्त'' सीढीको रूपमा कोर्दछ ।"

#: hacks/config/starfish.xml.h:1
msgid "Color Gradients"
msgstr "रंग ग्रेडियन्ट"

#: hacks/config/starfish.xml.h:7
msgid "Pulsating Blob"
msgstr "पलसाटिङ् बल्ब"

#: hacks/config/starfish.xml.h:10
msgid "Starfish"
msgstr "स्टारफिस"

#: hacks/config/starfish.xml.h:13
msgid ""
"This generates a sequence of undulating, throbbing, star-like patterns which "
"pulsate, rotate, and turn inside out. Another display mode uses these shapes "
"to lay down a field of colors, which are then cycled. The motion is very "
"organic. Written by Jamie Zawinski."
msgstr ""
"यसले फैलिरहेको, धड्किरहेको, तारा-जस्तै बाँन्कीहरूको क्रम सिर्जना गर्दछ जो भित्र बाहिर "
"धड्किन्छ, घुम्दछ र फर्कन्छ । अर्को प्रदर्शन मोडले रङको फाँट तल झार्न यी आकारहरू प्रयोग "
"गर्दछ, जुन त्यसपछि घुमाइन्छ । यो चाल धेरै चेतनशील छ । जामिइ जाविन्स्कीद्वारा लिखित ।"

#: hacks/config/starwars.xml.h:2
msgid "Anti-aliased Lines"
msgstr "विपरित उपनाम गरीएका पङ्क्ति"

#: hacks/config/starwars.xml.h:3
msgid "Centered Text"
msgstr "केन्द्रित पाठ"

#: hacks/config/starwars.xml.h:4
msgid ""
"Draws a stream of text slowly scrolling into the distance at an angle, over "
"a star field, like at the beginning of the movie of the same name. Written "
"by Jamie Zawinski and Claudio Matauoka."
msgstr ""
"उही नामको चलचित्रको सुरूआतमा जस्तै, ताराको फाँट माथि, एउटा कोणको दूरीमा विस्तारै "
"स्क्रोल गरिरहेको पाठको प्रवाह कोर्दछ । जामिइ जाविन्स्की र क्लाउडियो माटाउकाद्वारा "
"लिखित ।"

#: hacks/config/starwars.xml.h:5
msgid "Fade Out"
msgstr "फेड आउट"

#: hacks/config/starwars.xml.h:7
msgid "Flush Left Text"
msgstr "फ्लस बायाँ पाठ"

#: hacks/config/starwars.xml.h:8
msgid "Flush Right Text"
msgstr "फ्लस दायाँ पाठ"

#: hacks/config/starwars.xml.h:9
msgid "Font Point Size"
msgstr "फन्ट विन्दु साइज"

#: hacks/config/starwars.xml.h:10
msgid "Scroll Speed"
msgstr "स्क्रोल गती"

#: hacks/config/starwars.xml.h:13
msgid "Star Rotation Speed"
msgstr "तारा परिक्रमण गती"

#: hacks/config/starwars.xml.h:14
msgid "StarWars"
msgstr "स्टारवार"

#: hacks/config/starwars.xml.h:15
msgid "Text Columns"
msgstr "पाठ स्तम्भ"

#: hacks/config/starwars.xml.h:16
msgid "Text Lines"
msgstr "पाठ पङ्क्ति"

#: hacks/config/starwars.xml.h:18
msgid "Thick Lines"
msgstr "बाक्लो पङ्क्ति"

#: hacks/config/starwars.xml.h:19
msgid "Wrap Long Lines"
msgstr "लामो पङ्क्ति बेर्नुहोस्"

#: hacks/config/stonerview.xml.h:1
msgid ""
"Chains of colorful squares dance around each other in complex spiral "
"patterns. Written by Andrew Plotkin, based on SGI's `electropaint' "
"screensaver."
msgstr ""
"रङ्गिन वर्गहरूको श्रृंखला जटिल स्पाइरल बाँन्कीहरूमा एक अर्कोमा वरिपरि नाच्दछ । एसजीआईको "
"'इलेक्ट्रोपेन्ट' स्क्रिनसेभरमा आधारित, एन्ड्रिउ प्लटकिनद्वारा लिखित ।"

#: hacks/config/stonerview.xml.h:3
msgid "StonerView"
msgstr "कडा दृष्टि"

#: hacks/config/strange.xml.h:1
msgid "Curviness"
msgstr "बक्र"

#: hacks/config/strange.xml.h:9
msgid "Strange"
msgstr "अनौठो"

#: hacks/config/strange.xml.h:10
msgid ""
"This draws strange attractors: it's a colorful, unpredictably-animating "
"field of dots that swoops and twists around. The motion is very nice. "
"Written by Massimino Pascal."
msgstr ""
"यसले अनौठो आकर्षकहरू कोर्दछ: यो रङ्गिन, डटहरूको अकल्पनिय-एनिमेटिङ फाँट हो जुन वरिपरि "
"आकर्षण गर्दछ र घुमाउँदछ । चाल एकदम राम्रो छ । मासिमिनो पास्कलद्वारा लिखित ।"

#: hacks/config/superquadrics.xml.h:2
msgid ""
"Ed Mackey reports that he wrote the first version of this program in BASIC "
"on a Commodore 64 in 1987, as a 320x200 black and white wireframe. Now it is "
"GL and has specular reflections."
msgstr ""
"एड म्याकेले आफूले १९८७ मा ३२०x२०० कालो र सेतो तारफ्रेमको रूपमा, कमोडोर ६४ भित्र "
"आधारभूतमा यो कार्यक्रमको पहिलो संस्करण लेखेको कुरा प्रतिवेदन गर्दछ । हाल यो जीएल हो र "
"यो सँग पारदर्शी परावर्त्तनहरू छन् ।"

#: hacks/config/superquadrics.xml.h:10
msgid "Superquadrics"
msgstr "सुपरक्वाड्रिक्स"

#: hacks/config/swirl.xml.h:4
msgid ""
"More flowing, swirly patterns. This version is by M. Dobie and R. Taylor, "
"but you might have seen a Mac program similar to this called FlowFazer. "
"There is also a cool Java applet of a similar concept."
msgstr ""
"धेरै प्रवाह हुने, घुम्ने बाँन्कीहरू । यो संस्करण एम. डबिइ र आर. टेलरद्वारा गरिएको हो, तर "
"तपाईँले यो सँग मिल्ने फ्लोफाजर नाम गरेको म्याक कार्यक्रम देख्नुभएको हुन सक्छ । त्यहाँ त्यही "
"अवधारणाको नरम जाभा एप्लेट पनि छ ।"

#: hacks/config/swirl.xml.h:8
msgid "Swirl"
msgstr "घुमाइ"

#: hacks/config/t3d.xml.h:1
msgid "0°"
msgstr "०°"

#: hacks/config/t3d.xml.h:2
msgid "5 Minute Tick Marks"
msgstr "५ मिनेट सहि चिन्ह"

#: hacks/config/t3d.xml.h:3
msgid "90°"
msgstr "९०°"

#: hacks/config/t3d.xml.h:4
msgid "Bigger"
msgstr "ठूलो"

#: hacks/config/t3d.xml.h:5
msgid "Cycle Seconds"
msgstr "चक्रिय सेकेन्ड"

#: hacks/config/t3d.xml.h:10
msgid "Minute Tick Marks"
msgstr "मिनेट सहि चिन्ह"

#: hacks/config/t3d.xml.h:12
msgid "Smaller"
msgstr "सानो"

#: hacks/config/t3d.xml.h:14
msgid "T3D"
msgstr "Tत्रिआयामिक"

#: hacks/config/t3d.xml.h:15
msgid ""
"This draws a working analog clock composed of floating, throbbing bubbles. "
"Written by Bernd Paysan."
msgstr ""
"यसले बबलहरू उत्प्लवान, फैलावटको संयोजन भएको कार्य एनालग घडी कोर्दछ । बर्नड पेसानद्वारा "
"लिखित ।"

