msgstr "ट्वाङ्"

#: hacks/config/vermiculate.xml.h:1
msgid "Draws squiggly worm-like paths. Written by Tyler Pierce."
msgstr "बाङ्गो कीरा-जस्तो मार्ग कोर्दछ । टाइलर पियर्सद्वारा लिखित ।"

#: hacks/config/vermiculate.xml.h:2
